{"type":"message","id":"c35f08fb","parentId":"0224c0ec","timestamp":"2026-07-06T09:21:46.958Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"vvXqo4av","toolName":"cron","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7288d228-3e86-47b0-af67-59e7a057e356\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"Daily Weather Report\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1780264783242,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 6 * * *\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"강릉의 오늘 날씨를 확인해서 보고해줘. 체감 온도를 고려해서 어떤 옷을 입으면 좋을지도 추천해줘. 형준 님에게 직접 보고하는 형식이니 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지해줘.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"to\": \"7890734506\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1783371600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1783285200015,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 14257,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastFailureNotificationDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"consecutiveSkipped\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      },\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1783285214272\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"16a3c6b4-af1e-4312-8525-5fd1943cfd78\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"morning-briefing\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1783329232853,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"expr\": \"30 6 * * 1-5\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"message\": \"아침 브리핑 시간이다. 다음 RSS 피드에서 최근 12시간 내 기사를 수집해라. \\n요청 시 브라우저 User-Agent 헤더를 붙여라.\\n\\n[매일경제]\\n- https://www.mk.co.kr/rss/30000001/\\n- https://www.mk.co.kr/rss/30100041/\\n- https://www.mk.co.kr/rss/50200011/\\n- https://www.mk.co.kr/rss/50300009/\\n- https://www.mk.co.kr/rss/30300018/\\n\\n[한국경제]\\n- https://www.hankyung.com/feed/economy\\n- https://www.hankyung.com/feed/finance\\n- https://www.hankyung.com/feed/realestate\\n- https://www.hankyung.com/feed/international\\n\\n수집 기사 중 시장 영향이 큰 3~5개를 골라 SOUL.md의 브리핑 규칙대로 분석하고 텔레그램 형식으로 보내라. 기사 원문을 인용하지 말고 네 말로 재구성하고 링크를 첨부해라.\",\n        \"model\": \"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 300,\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1783373400000\n      },\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1783329232853\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2e59001e-5be0-4d04-b1f6-7558844f33cf\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"Daily Economy News Summary\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1779446630472,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 7 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"오늘의 핵심 경제 뉴스 10개를 신뢰할 수 있는 매체에서 꼼꼼히 선정해서 브리핑해줘. 뉴스 선정 시 경제적 영향력이 큰 기사를 우선으로 하고, 각 뉴스마다 핵심 요약과 함께 반드시 원문 링크를 포함해줘. 형준 님에게 직접 보고하는 형식이니 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지해줘.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\",\n        \"to\": \"7890734506\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1783375200000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1783288800017,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 12267,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastFailureNotificationDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"consecutiveSkipped\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      },\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1783288812284\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 3,\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"limit\": 3,\n  \"hasMore\": false,\n  \"nextOffset\": null,\n  \"deliveryPreviews\": {\n    \"7288d228-3e86-47b0-af67-59e7a057e356\": {\n      \"label\": \"announce -> telegram:7890734506\",\n      \"detail\": \"explicit\"\n    },\n    \"16a3c6b4-af1e-4312-8525-5fd1943cfd78\": {\n      \"label\": \"announce -> telegram:telegram:7890734506\",\n      \"detail\": \"explicit\"\n    },\n    \"2e59001e-5be0-4d04-b1f6-7558844f33cf\": {\n      \"label\": \"announce -> telegram:7890734506\",\n      \"detail\": \"explicit\"\n    }\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"jobs":[{"id":"7288d228-3e86-47b0-af67-59e7a057e356","agentId":"main","sessionKey":"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506","name":"Daily Weather Report","enabled":true,"createdAtMs":1780264783242,"schedule":{"tz":"Asia/Seoul","kind":"cron","expr":"0 6 * * *"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"kind":"agentTurn","message":"강릉의 오늘 날씨를 확인해서 보고해줘. 체감 온도를 고려해서 어떤 옷을 입으면 좋을지도 추천해줘. 형준 님에게 직접 보고하는 형식이니 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지해줘."},"delivery":{"to":"7890734506","mode":"announce","channel":"telegram"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1783371600000,"lastRunAtMs":1783285200015,"lastRunStatus":"ok","lastStatus":"ok","lastDurationMs":14257,"lastDeliveryStatus":"delivered","lastFailureNotificationDeliveryStatus":"not-requested","consecutiveErrors":0,"consecutiveSkipped":0,"lastDelivered":true},"updatedAtMs":1783285214272},{"id":"16a3c6b4-af1e-4312-8525-5fd1943cfd78","agentId":"main","sessionKey":"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506","name":"morning-briefing","enabled":true,"createdAtMs":1783329232853,"schedule":{"expr":"30 6 * * 1-5","tz":"Asia/Seoul","kind":"cron"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":